   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>What is the <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-value of the <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-intercept of this equation’s graph?</li>\n  </ol>",
